1. DEFINITIONS

"Licensed Material" means the software, source code, compiled code,
documentation, and all literary content made available under this License,
including but not limited to poems and associated metadata.

"Literary Content" means any textual or artistic work included in the Licensed
Material, including poems authored by the Licensor or third parties.

"Use" means to access, view, read, or privately interact with the Licensed
Material.

"Internal Use" means use by a single natural person or within a single legal
entity, strictly for its own internal purposes and not for the benefit of any
third party.

"Academic Purpose" means non-commercial scholarly research, teaching, or
publication conducted within a recognized academic or educational context,
and not primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or
monetary compensation.

"Text and Data Mining" or "TDM" means any automated analytical technique
aimed at analyzing text, data, or patterns, including but not limited to
scraping, parsing, tokenizing, embedding, indexing, or transforming the
Licensed Material for the purpose of extracting information or training
computational models.

"Machine Learning" or "ML" means any computational process that uses data to
train, fine-tune, evaluate, or improve models, including but not limited to
artificial intelligence systems, neural networks, or statistical learning
algorithms.

